1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,937
What the difference between paying fifteen dollars with cash... and fifteen dollars with card?

2
00:00:04,937 --> 00:00:06,037
Same burger.

3
00:00:06,037 --> 00:00:07,050
Same soda.

4
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,625
Same fifteen dollars.

5
00:00:08,625 --> 00:00:09,675
This is Doug.

6
00:00:09,675 --> 00:00:10,775
Doug is hungry.

7
00:00:10,775 --> 00:00:12,200
Doug go to Puffin Burger.

8
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,200
One burger.

9
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,137
One soda.

10
00:00:14,137 --> 00:00:15,400
Fifteen dollars.

11
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,625
Doug pay cash.

12
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:19,050
Puffin put fifteen dollars in the box.

13
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:19,862
All of it.

14
00:00:19,862 --> 00:00:20,737
Next day.

15
00:00:20,737 --> 00:00:21,837
Same burger.

16
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:22,850
Same soda.

17
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,962
This time, Doug pay with card.

18
00:00:24,962 --> 00:00:25,650
Beep.

19
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,237
Puffin get a little less than fifteen dollars.

20
00:00:28,237 --> 00:00:29,425
Where is the rest?

21
00:00:29,425 --> 00:00:30,725
It pay for the beep.

22
00:00:30,725 --> 00:00:31,800
The card machine.

23
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,925
The card company.

24
00:00:32,925 --> 00:00:34,587
Keeping Doug money safe.

25
00:00:34,587 --> 00:00:35,987
Puffin do not mind.

26
00:00:35,987 --> 00:00:37,187
Card is fast.

27
00:00:37,187 --> 00:00:38,350
Customers love it.

28
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:41,000
But every beep cost Puffin a few cents.

29
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,537
Puffin Burger is busy.

30
00:00:42,537 --> 00:00:44,125
One hundred customers a day.

31
00:00:44,125 --> 00:00:45,800
Most of them pay with card.

32
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,487
Beep.

33
00:00:46,487 --> 00:00:47,175
Beep.

34
00:00:47,175 --> 00:00:47,862
Beep.

35
00:00:47,862 --> 00:00:51,287
A few cents... times one hundred beeps... every day.

36
00:00:51,287 --> 00:00:53,325
That is real money for a small shop.

37
00:00:53,325 --> 00:00:55,787
So one day... the burger price go up.

38
00:00:55,787 --> 00:00:56,575
A little.

39
00:00:56,575 --> 00:00:57,587
For everybody.

40
00:00:57,587 --> 00:00:58,550
Card people.

41
00:00:58,550 --> 00:00:59,525
Cash people.

42
00:00:59,525 --> 00:01:00,200
Doug.

43
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,900
Card people get points back.

44
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,062
Cash people get... nothing extra.

45
00:01:04,062 --> 00:01:07,300
Some shops say: pay cash, small discount.

46
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,650
Some shops say: pay card, small extra fee.

47
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:12,812
Now Doug look at the sign before he pay.

48
00:01:12,812 --> 00:01:15,675
Card: fast, safe, points.

49
00:01:15,675 --> 00:01:19,050
Cash: no beep, no extra cost for Puffin.

50
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:20,325
Cash or card?

51
00:01:20,325 --> 00:01:21,500
Which one you use?

52
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:23,150
Tell Doug in the comments.

